#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:9
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Písať"

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:9
msgid "Speak"
msgstr "Hovoriť"

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:9
msgid "Suggest a description"
msgstr "Navrhnúť opis"

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:13
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_modes.html:2
msgid "How would you like to describe it?"
msgstr "Ako ho chcete opísať?"

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:19
msgid "What would you like to say about this picture?"
msgstr "Čo chcete povedať o tomto obrázku?"

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:20
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:18
msgid "Language I am using"
msgstr "Jazyk, ktorý používam"

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:22
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:22
msgid "AI voice"
msgstr "Hlas AI"

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:23
msgid ""
"I have permission to send this picture, description and dictionary vocabulary"
" to OpenAI and approve the estimated API costs shown here."
msgstr ""
"Mám povolenie odoslať tento obrázok, opis a slovnú zásobu slovníka do OpenAI "
"a schvaľujem tu uvedené odhadované náklady na API."

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:50
msgid "Take or choose a picture."
msgstr "Odfotografujte alebo vyberte obrázok."

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:55
msgid "Record or upload your description."
msgstr "Nahrajte svoj opis mikrofónom alebo zo súboru."

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:59
msgid "Say what you mean by this picture."
msgstr "Povedzte, čo chcete týmto obrázkom vyjadriť."

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:64
msgid "Word or expression"
msgstr "Slovo alebo výraz"

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:65
msgid "Translation / meaning"
msgstr "Preklad / význam"

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:66
msgid "As used in the sentence (optional)"
msgstr "Tvar použitý vo vete (nepovinné)"

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:67
msgid "Use … between separated parts, or leave blank."
msgstr "Medzi oddelenými časťami použite … alebo nechajte pole prázdne."

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:77
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Odstrániť"

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:89
msgid "This word and meaning appear twice. Remove one copy."
msgstr ""
"Toto slovo s týmto významom sa vyskytuje dvakrát. Odstráňte jednu kópiu."

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:92
msgid "Copy the form from the sentence, use … for a gap, or leave this blank."
msgstr ""
"Skopírujte tvar z vety, medzeru označte pomocou … alebo nechajte pole "
"prázdne."

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:109
msgid "Images to copy"
msgstr "Obrázky na skopírovanie"

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:110
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/dictionary.html:14
msgid "Accepted"
msgstr "Schválené"

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:110
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/dictionary.html:14
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/entry.html:4
msgid "Awaiting review"
msgstr "Čaká na kontrolu"

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:110
msgid "Both"
msgstr "Oboje"

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:116
msgid "Name of the new dictionary"
msgstr "Názov nového slovníka"

#: community_dictionary/capture_forms.py:117
msgid "I have permission to copy these images into a new dictionary."
msgstr "Mám povolenie skopírovať tieto obrázky do nového slovníka."

#: community_dictionary/capture_views.py:253
msgid "The wording changed. Read the latest entry before marking it checked."
msgstr ""
"Znenie sa zmenilo. Pred označením za skontrolované si prečítajte najnovšiu "
"verziu položky."

#: community_dictionary/capture_views.py:254
msgid "Add the wording first."
msgstr "Najprv pridajte text."

#: community_dictionary/capture_views.py:258
msgid "Current wording marked as linguistically checked."
msgstr "Aktuálne znenie bolo označené ako jazykovo skontrolované."

#: community_dictionary/evaluation_views.py:89
msgid ""
"Only multi-word entries in English, French, Swedish, German, Italian or "
"Icelandic"
msgstr ""
"Iba viacslovné položky v angličtine, francúzštine, švédčine, nemčine, "
"taliančine alebo islandčine"

#: community_dictionary/evaluation_views.py:90
msgid ""
"For word pages or word audio only. Japanese uses explicit selection on the "
"expression-audio page."
msgstr ""
"Iba pre stránky slov alebo zvukové nahrávky slov. Japončina používa výslovný "
"výber na stránke zvukových nahrávok výrazov."

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:11
msgid "Enable Picture descriptions (OpenAI)"
msgstr "Povoliť opisy obrázkov (OpenAI)"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:11
msgid ""
"Optional experiment: members describe a picture by voice or text, confirm its"
" meaning, and publish a sentence with linked words and synthetic audio. "
"Contributor confirmation allows immediate publication; editors can check "
"language afterwards. Picture, description and up to 200 words/meanings are "
"sent to OpenAI. Off by default."
msgstr ""
"Voliteľný experiment: členovia opíšu obrázok hlasom alebo textom, potvrdia "
"jeho význam a zverejnia vetu s prepojenými slovami a syntetickou zvukovou "
"nahrávkou. Potvrdenie prispievateľa umožňuje okamžité zverejnenie; redaktori "
"môžu jazyk skontrolovať neskôr. Obrázok, opis a najviac 200 slov/významov sa "
"odošle do OpenAI. Predvolene vypnuté."

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:12
msgid "Enable AI picture generation (OpenAI)"
msgstr "Povoliť generovanie obrázkov pomocou AI (OpenAI)"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:12
msgid ""
"Owners and editors can approve a shared style and generate pictures from "
"descriptions. Off by default. Each request needs permission to send its text "
"to OpenAI and incurs API costs."
msgstr ""
"Vlastníci a redaktori môžu schváliť spoločný štýl a generovať obrázky z "
"opisov. Predvolene vypnuté. Každá požiadavka vyžaduje povolenie odoslať jej "
"text do OpenAI a je spojená s nákladmi na API."

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:13
msgid "Enable Learn from a photo (OpenAI)"
msgstr "Povoliť učenie z fotografie (OpenAI)"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:13
msgid ""
"Members can choose to send a photo and the language names to OpenAI. Each "
"request requires confirmation and incurs API costs. Uncheck if your community"
" does not permit this processing."
msgstr ""
"Členovia sa môžu rozhodnúť odoslať fotografiu a názvy jazykov do OpenAI. "
"Každá požiadavka vyžaduje potvrdenie a je spojená s nákladmi na API. Ak vaša "
"komunita toto spracovanie nepovoľuje, zrušte začiarknutie."

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:14
msgid "Enable saved spoken audio (OpenAI)"
msgstr "Povoliť ukladanie syntetických zvukových nahrávok (OpenAI)"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:14
msgid ""
"Members can generate synthetic audio from accepted words in supported "
"languages, with confirmation and API costs. Human microphone recording works "
"whether this is enabled or not."
msgstr ""
"Členovia môžu po potvrdení a za poplatok za API generovať syntetické zvukové "
"nahrávky zo schválených slov v podporovaných jazykoch. Ľudské nahrávanie "
"mikrofónom funguje bez ohľadu na toto nastavenie."

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:19
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Názov"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:19
msgid "Language we are collecting"
msgstr "Jazyk slovníka"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:20
msgid "Language for explanations (optional)"
msgstr "Jazyk vysvetlení (nepovinné)"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:21
msgid "Text direction"
msgstr "Smer textu"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:28
msgid ""
"Saved TTS is not configured for this language. Keep using human recordings."
msgstr ""
"Pre tento jazyk nie je nakonfigurované ukladanie syntetických nahrávok. "
"Naďalej používajte ľudské nahrávky."

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:32
msgid ""
"Enable saved audio and choose a supported explanation language for picture "
"descriptions."
msgstr ""
"Povoľte ukladanie zvukových nahrávok a vyberte podporovaný jazyk vysvetlení "
"pre opisy obrázkov."

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:47
msgid "Take or choose a photo"
msgstr "Odfotografovať alebo vybrať fotografiu"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:48
msgid ""
"I have permission to send this photo to OpenAI for this analysis, at the cost"
" shown above."
msgstr ""
"Mám povolenie odoslať túto fotografiu do OpenAI na túto analýzu za cenu "
"uvedenú vyššie."

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:61
msgid "Word"
msgstr "Slovo"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:62
msgid "Meaning or translation"
msgstr "Význam alebo preklad"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:63
msgid "I have permission to share this photo with the dictionary."
msgstr "Mám povolenie zdieľať túto fotografiu so slovníkom."

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:64
msgid "Accept this entry now (editors only)"
msgstr "Schváliť túto položku teraz (iba redaktori)"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:70
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/contribute.html:32
msgid "Voice"
msgstr "Hlas"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:70
msgid ""
"Your selection is remembered for this dictionary. Generate a preview to hear "
"it before saving. Choosing another voice and generating again is a new paid "
"request."
msgstr ""
"Váš výber sa pre tento slovník zapamätá. Pred uložením vytvorte ukážku a "
"vypočujte si ju. Výber iného hlasu a opätovné generovanie predstavuje novú "
"platenú požiadavku."

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:71
msgid ""
"I have permission to send this wording, language and available meaning to "
"OpenAI for audio and pronunciation guidance, including one retry for silent "
"audio, at the costs shown above."
msgstr ""
"Mám povolenie odoslať toto znenie, jazyk a dostupný význam do OpenAI na "
"vytvorenie zvukovej nahrávky a pokynov k výslovnosti, vrátane jedného "
"opakovania pri tichej nahrávke, za cenu uvedenú vyššie."

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:75
msgid ""
"I have listened to this synthetic recording and have permission to share it "
"with the dictionary."
msgstr ""
"Vypočul/a som si túto syntetickú nahrávku a mám povolenie zdieľať ju so "
"slovníkom."

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:76
msgid "Accept this recording now (editors only)"
msgstr "Schváliť túto nahrávku teraz (iba redaktori)"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:80
msgid "Audio"
msgstr "Zvuk"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:81
msgid ""
"I have permission to share these pictures or recordings with this dictionary."
msgstr "Mám povolenie zdieľať tieto obrázky alebo nahrávky s týmto slovníkom."

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:89
msgid "Confirm permission to share your media with the dictionary."
msgstr "Potvrďte povolenie zdieľať svoje médiá so slovníkom."

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:98
msgid "Photo"
msgstr "Fotografia"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:99
msgid "Word or phrase (optional)"
msgstr "Slovo alebo výraz (nepovinné)"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:100
msgid "Meaning or context (optional)"
msgstr "Význam alebo kontext (nepovinné)"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:101
msgid "Category (optional)"
msgstr "Kategória (nepovinné)"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:102
msgid "About this recording or picture (optional)"
msgstr "Informácie o tejto nahrávke alebo obrázku (nepovinné)"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:110
msgid "Meaning or translation (optional)"
msgstr "Význam alebo preklad (nepovinné)"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:111
msgid "A translation or short explanation"
msgstr "Preklad alebo krátke vysvetlenie"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:117
msgid "Contributor"
msgstr "Prispievateľ"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:117
msgid "Myself"
msgstr "Ja"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:118
msgid ""
"I have this person’s permission to contribute this material and give them "
"control of it."
msgstr ""
"Mám povolenie tejto osoby pridať tento materiál a zveriť jej kontrolu nad "
"ním."

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:120
#, python-format
msgid "Word or phrase in %(language)s (optional)"
msgstr "Slovo alebo výraz v jazyku %(language)s (nepovinné)"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:122
#, python-format
msgid "Meaning or translation in %(language)s (optional)"
msgstr "Význam alebo preklad v jazyku %(language)s (nepovinné)"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:127
msgid "Confirm that you have this person’s permission."
msgstr "Potvrďte, že máte povolenie tejto osoby."

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:132
msgid "Add a picture, recording or some written information."
msgstr "Pridajte obrázok, nahrávku alebo písomné informácie."

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:143
msgid "Existing word or phrase"
msgstr "Existujúce slovo alebo výraz"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:143
msgid "Choose a word…"
msgstr "Vyberte slovo…"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:151 community_dictionary/public_browsing.py:93
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/contribute.html:24
msgid "Picture"
msgstr "Obrázok"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:152
msgid "About this picture (optional)"
msgstr "Informácie o tomto obrázku (nepovinné)"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:162
msgid "About this recording (optional)"
msgstr "Informácie o tejto nahrávke (nepovinné)"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:168
msgid "Record or choose an audio file before saving."
msgstr "Pred uložením vytvorte nahrávku alebo vyberte zvukový súbor."

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:173
msgid "Comment (optional if you record it)"
msgstr "Komentár (nepovinné, ak ho nahráte hlasom)"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:178
msgid "Write or record a comment."
msgstr "Napíšte alebo nahrajte komentár."

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:183
msgid "Ask this partnership"
msgstr "Požiadať túto partnerskú skupinu"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:184
msgid "What would help?"
msgstr "Čo by pomohlo?"

#: community_dictionary/forms.py:185
msgid "Explain your request (optional)"
msgstr "Vysvetlite svoju požiadavku (nepovinné)"

#: community_dictionary/lexicon_views.py:36
msgid "Choose a word to link or a link to remove."
msgstr "Vyberte slovo na prepojenie alebo prepojenie na odstránenie."

#: community_dictionary/lexicon_views.py:59
msgid "Word linked to this picture."
msgstr "Slovo bolo prepojené s týmto obrázkom."

#: community_dictionary/lexicon_views.py:64
msgid "Word link removed. The word and picture are unchanged."
msgstr "Prepojenie slova bolo odstránené. Slovo a obrázok zostali nezmenené."

#: community_dictionary/localisation.py:68
msgid "Choose English or Français."
msgstr "Vyberte English alebo Français."

#: community_dictionary/practice_views.py:52
msgid "Choose a flashcard direction."
msgstr "Vyberte smer prekladania na kartičkách."

#: community_dictionary/practice_views.py:55
msgid "Choose multiple choice or reveal the answer."
msgstr "Vyberte výber z možností alebo odkrytie odpovede."

#: community_dictionary/practice_views.py:59
msgid ""
"There are not enough distinct answers for multiple choice in this category. "
"Choose another category or use Reveal the answer."
msgstr ""
"V tejto kategórii nie je dostatok odlišných odpovedí na výber z možností. "
"Vyberte inú kategóriu alebo použite Odkryť odpoveď."

#: community_dictionary/practice_views.py:67
msgid ""
"We need at least two different picture words that fit together. Try another "
"category or add some shorter words."
msgstr ""
"Potrebujeme aspoň dve rôzne slová s obrázkami, ktoré sa dajú spojiť. Skúste "
"inú kategóriu alebo pridajte kratšie slová."

#: community_dictionary/practice_views.py:69
msgid "Choose a game."
msgstr "Vyberte hru."

#: community_dictionary/profile_views.py:28
msgid "Public name (a pseudonym is fine)"
msgstr "Verejné meno (môže byť aj prezývka)"

#: community_dictionary/profile_views.py:29
msgid "Short introduction (optional)"
msgstr "Krátke predstavenie (nepovinné)"

#: community_dictionary/profile_views.py:30
msgid "List me as a contributor"
msgstr "Uviesť ma v zozname prispievateľov"

#: community_dictionary/profile_views.py:36
msgid "Choose the name you want people to see."
msgstr "Vyberte meno, ktoré sa má zobrazovať ostatným."

#: community_dictionary/profile_views.py:41
msgid "Timezone"
msgstr "Časové pásmo"

#: community_dictionary/profile_views.py:42
msgid "New OpenAI API key"
msgstr "Nový kľúč API OpenAI"

#: community_dictionary/profile_views.py:44
msgid "Leave blank to keep your saved key. It is never shown on public pages."
msgstr ""
"Ak chcete ponechať uložený kľúč, nechajte pole prázdne. Na verejných "
"stránkach sa nikdy nezobrazuje."

#: community_dictionary/profile_views.py:45
msgid "Remove my saved API key"
msgstr "Odstrániť môj uložený kľúč API"

#: community_dictionary/profile_views.py:50
msgid "Use my own OpenAI API key instead of platform credits"
msgstr "Použiť môj vlastný kľúč API OpenAI namiesto kreditov platformy"

#: community_dictionary/profile_views.py:56
msgid "Choose either a new key or removal of the saved key."
msgstr "Vyberte buď nový kľúč, alebo odstránenie uloženého kľúča."

#: community_dictionary/profile_views.py:58
msgid "Supply a key, or turn off this option to use platform credits."
msgstr ""
"Zadajte kľúč alebo vypnite túto možnosť, ak chcete používať kredity "
"platformy."

#: community_dictionary/profile_views.py:82
msgid "Your public profile changed. Reload Profile before saving."
msgstr "Váš verejný profil sa zmenil. Pred uložením znovu načítajte Profil."

#: community_dictionary/profile_views.py:86
msgid "Contributor listing saved."
msgstr "Zaradenie do zoznamu prispievateľov bolo uložené."

#: community_dictionary/profile_views.py:96
msgid "Account preferences saved."
msgstr "Nastavenia účtu boli uložené."

#: community_dictionary/profile_views.py:99
msgid "Choose which profile settings to save."
msgstr "Vyberte nastavenia profilu, ktoré chcete uložiť."

#: community_dictionary/profile_views.py:104
msgid "Dictionary no longer listed"
msgstr "Slovník už nie je uvedený v zozname"

#: community_dictionary/public_browsing.py:93
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/entry.html:23
msgid "Recording"
msgstr "Nahrávka"

#: community_dictionary/public_views.py:26
msgid ""
"I have permission from the contributors to make the accepted content in this "
"dictionary available to anyone, including future accepted content."
msgstr ""
"Mám povolenie prispievateľov sprístupniť schválený obsah tohto slovníka "
"komukoľvek, vrátane obsahu schváleného v budúcnosti."

#: community_dictionary/public_views.py:143
msgid "Reload Settings and choose whether to allow public browsing."
msgstr ""
"Znovu načítajte Nastavenia a vyberte, či chcete povoliť verejné prehliadanie."

#: community_dictionary/public_views.py:147
msgid ""
"Make this dictionary visible and confirm permission from its contributors "
"before enabling public browsing."
msgstr ""
"Pred povolením verejného prehliadania zviditeľnite tento slovník a potvrďte "
"povolenie jeho prispievateľov."

#: community_dictionary/public_views.py:151
msgid "Public browsing changed. Reload Settings before trying again."
msgstr ""
"Nastavenie verejného prehliadania sa zmenilo. Pred ďalším pokusom znovu "
"načítajte Nastavenia."

#: community_dictionary/public_views.py:157
msgid "Public browsing enabled."
msgstr "Verejné prehliadanie bolo povolené."

#: community_dictionary/public_views.py:157
msgid "Public browsing disabled."
msgstr "Verejné prehliadanie bolo vypnuté."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/_evaluation_competences.html:2
msgid "Language competences saved for this evaluation"
msgstr "Jazykové zručnosti boli uložené pre toto hodnotenie"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/_evaluation_competences.html:2
msgid "Your current language competences"
msgstr "Vaše aktuálne jazykové zručnosti"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/_evaluation_competences.html:6
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/evaluation_languages.html:3
msgid "Reading:"
msgstr "Čítanie:"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/_evaluation_competences.html:6
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/evaluation_languages.html:3
msgid "Listening:"
msgstr "Počúvanie:"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/_evaluation_competences.html:9
msgid ""
"These are the self-reports saved when you started. Later Profile changes "
"apply to new evaluations."
msgstr ""
"Toto sú vaše vlastné údaje uložené pri začatí hodnotenia. Neskoršie zmeny v "
"Profile sa použijú pri nových hodnoteniach."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/_evaluation_competences.html:9
msgid "These are self-reports. Select only the aspects you feel able to judge."
msgstr ""
"Ide o vaše vlastné posúdenie. Vyberte iba aspekty, ktoré sa cítite schopní "
"hodnotiť."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/_evaluation_competences.html:10
msgid "Add or update your language competences"
msgstr "Pridať alebo aktualizovať jazykové zručnosti"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/_evaluation_competences.html:10
msgid ", then return here"
msgstr ", potom sa sem vráťte"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:1
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/base.html:10
msgid "About"
msgstr "O aplikácii"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:2
msgid "Made together"
msgstr "Vytvorené spoločne"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:2
msgid "About Community Dictionaries"
msgstr "O komunitných slovníkoch"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:2
msgid ""
"Build language resources from the pictures, voices and experiences that "
"matter to your group."
msgstr ""
"Tvorte jazykové zdroje z obrázkov, hlasov a skúseností, ktoré sú pre vašu "
"skupinu dôležité."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:3
msgid "Start with everyday life"
msgstr "Začnite každodenným životom"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:3
msgid ""
"Take a photograph or upload one, add words or a sentence, and record someone "
"saying them. People can contribute different parts: one person supplies a "
"picture, another the language and voice. Pictures, sentences and word pages "
"link together so you can explore them in either direction."
msgstr ""
"Odfotografujte alebo nahrajte fotografiu, pridajte slová alebo vetu a "
"nahrajte ich výslovnosť. Ľudia môžu prispieť rôznymi časťami: jeden dodá "
"obrázok, druhý jazykový obsah a hlas. Obrázky, vety a stránky slov sú "
"navzájom prepojené, takže ich môžete skúmať oboma smermi."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:4
msgid ""
"No programming or software installation is needed. Use a phone for "
"photographs, recordings and browsing, or a laptop when you prefer a larger "
"screen for editing. Creating a dictionary, manual contributions and browsing "
"have no platform charge under the current hosted arrangement."
msgstr ""
"Nie je potrebné programovať ani inštalovať softvér. Na fotografovanie, "
"nahrávanie a prehliadanie používajte telefón alebo notebook, ak pri úpravách "
"uprednostňujete väčšiu obrazovku. Pri súčasnom spôsobe poskytovania služby sa"
" za vytvorenie slovníka, ručné príspevky ani prehliadanie neúčtuje poplatok "
"platformy."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:5
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/base.html:11
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/home.html:5
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/public_home.html:2
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/public_home.html:3
msgid "Find dictionaries"
msgstr "Nájsť slovníky"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:5
msgid "Your dictionaries / create one"
msgstr "Vaše slovníky / vytvoriť nový"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:6
msgid "Your language, your choices"
msgstr "Váš jazyk, vaše rozhodnutia"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:6
msgid ""
"Human pictures, text and recordings work without AI support for the language."
" Where suitable AI support is available, you can optionally ask for picture "
"descriptions, translations, speech or generated illustrations. An owner can "
"add missing sentences to a collection of pictures, then build vocabulary from"
" the reviewed sentences."
msgstr ""
"Obrázky, texty a nahrávky od ľudí fungujú aj bez podpory AI pre daný jazyk. "
"Ak je k dispozícii vhodná podpora AI, môžete voliteľne požiadať o opisy "
"obrázkov, preklady, reč alebo generované ilustrácie. Vlastník môže do zbierky"
" obrázkov doplniť chýbajúce vety a potom vytvoriť slovnú zásobu zo "
"skontrolovaných viet."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:7
msgid ""
"AI suggestions can be wrong and should be checked by someone who knows the "
"language. Optional AI processing can spend credits and send selected material"
" to a provider; the relevant tools explain their processing and costs. It is "
"not required for manual dictionary work."
msgstr ""
"Návrhy AI môžu byť nesprávne a mal by ich skontrolovať niekto, kto jazyk "
"pozná. Voliteľné spracovanie AI môže spotrebovať kredity a odoslať vybraný "
"materiál poskytovateľovi; príslušné nástroje vysvetľujú spracovanie a "
"náklady. Pri ručnej práci so slovníkom sa nevyžaduje."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:8
msgid ""
"Members, and visitors to dictionaries with public browsing enabled, can "
"practise with flashcards, picture crosswords and word-search puzzles using "
"the dictionary's existing material. These exercises make no paid AI calls."
msgstr ""
"Členovia a návštevníci slovníkov s povoleným verejným prehliadaním môžu "
"precvičovať pomocou kartičiek, obrázkových krížoviek a osemsmeroviek s "
"použitím existujúceho obsahu slovníka. Tieto cvičenia neposielajú žiadne "
"platené požiadavky AI."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:9
msgid "Decide what to share"
msgstr "Rozhodnite, čo chcete zdieľať"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:9
msgid ""
"Dictionaries start private and unlisted. Owners can make a dictionary "
"<strong>discoverable</strong>, showing its name, languages and accepted entry"
" counts so people can request membership. This does not expose its contents."
msgstr ""
"Slovníky sú na začiatku súkromné a neuvedené v zozname. Vlastníci môžu "
"slovník <strong>zaradiť do ponuky</strong>, čím zobrazia jeho názov, jazyky a"
" počty schválených položiek, aby ľudia mohli požiadať o členstvo. Jeho obsah "
"sa tým nesprístupní."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:10
msgid ""
"<strong>Public browsing</strong> is a separate owner choice, made with "
"contributor permission. It allows anyone with the link to browse accepted "
"learning material. A public dictionary only appears in the discovery list if "
"it is also discoverable."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Verejné prehliadanie</strong> je samostatné rozhodnutie vlastníka, "
"ktoré vyžaduje povolenie prispievateľov. Umožňuje každému s odkazom "
"prehliadať schválený učebný obsah. Verejný slovník sa zobrazí v ponuke iba "
"vtedy, ak je do nej aj zaradený."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:11
msgid ""
"Contributors can withdraw all their contributions from a dictionary into "
"their private collection and later restore them. Withdrawal blocks subsequent"
" access to the hosted material, but cannot recall copies people already "
"received. Hidden dictionaries are not advertised. Your personal contributor "
"listing is optional too."
msgstr ""
"Prispievatelia môžu všetky svoje príspevky zo slovníka odobrať do svojej "
"súkromnej zbierky a neskôr ich vrátiť. Odobratie zablokuje ďalší prístup k "
"materiálu v tejto službe, ale nedokáže vziať späť kópie, ktoré už ľudia "
"získali. Skryté slovníky sa nepropagujú. Aj vaše zaradenie do zoznamu "
"prispievateľov je nepovinné."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:12
msgid "A project that learns from its users"
msgstr "Projekt, ktorý sa učí od svojich používateľov"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:12
msgid ""
"Community Dictionaries is part of the open-source C-LARA project. AI has "
"written the application code and technical documentation through an iterative"
" collaboration with people who propose requirements, install releases, test "
"them and give feedback. The aim is to make useful changes quickly while "
"keeping the app understandable."
msgstr ""
"Komunitné slovníky sú súčasťou projektu C-LARA s otvoreným zdrojovým kódom. "
"Kód aplikácie a technickú dokumentáciu napísala AI v opakovanej spolupráci s "
"ľuďmi, ktorí navrhujú požiadavky, inštalujú vydania, testujú ich a poskytujú "
"spätnú väzbu. Cieľom je rýchlo robiť užitočné zmeny a zároveň zachovať "
"zrozumiteľnosť aplikácie."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:13
msgid ""
"The project is still developing. We are investigating how well this approach "
"serves different language communities, and how much technical work AI can "
"reliably take on over time. Independent community trials and long-term "
"results are still needed."
msgstr ""
"Projekt sa naďalej vyvíja. Skúmame, ako dobre tento prístup slúži rôznym "
"jazykovým komunitám a koľko technickej práce dokáže AI dlhodobo spoľahlivo "
"prevziať. Stále sú potrebné nezávislé komunitné skúšky a dlhodobé výsledky."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:14
msgid "Source code and project documentation"
msgstr "Zdrojový kód a dokumentácia projektu"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:15
msgid "Publications"
msgstr "Publikácie"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:16
msgid "Community Dictionaries: Everyday Pictures, Rapid Human–AI Development"
msgstr ""
"Komunitné slovníky: každodenné obrázky, rýchly vývoj v spolupráci ľudí a AI"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:16
msgid "ChatGPT C-LARA-Instance and Manny Rayner (2026)."
msgstr "ChatGPT C-LARA-Instance a Manny Rayner (2026)."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:17
msgid ""
"Our first report describes the working app, its development and an invitation"
" to help shape the next version."
msgstr ""
"Naša prvá správa opisuje fungujúcu aplikáciu, jej vývoj a pozvanie pomôcť "
"formovať ďalšiu verziu."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:18
msgid "Read on AiraXiv"
msgstr "Čítať na AiraXiv"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:18
msgid "Read on ResearchGate"
msgstr "Čítať na ResearchGate"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:19
msgid ""
"Related reading: <a href=\"https://airaxiv.com/papers/view/2610.0009/\">Vibe "
"Research</a>, by Manny Rayner and ChatGPT C-LARA-Instance, discusses the "
"broader human–AI research collaboration."
msgstr ""
"Súvisiace čítanie: <a "
"href=\"https://airaxiv.com/papers/view/2610.0009/\">Vibe Research</a> od "
"Mannyho Raynera a ChatGPT C-LARA-Instance sa zaoberá širšou výskumnou "
"spoluprácou ľudí a AI."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:20
msgid "Contributors"
msgstr "Prispievatelia"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:20
msgid ""
"People who have chosen to be listed. Names and introductions are supplied by "
"the account holders. This is a community listing, not the author list of a "
"publication."
msgstr ""
"Ľudia, ktorí sa rozhodli byť uvedení v zozname. Mená a predstavenia poskytli "
"držitelia účtov. Ide o zoznam komunity, nie o zoznam autorov publikácie."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:21
msgid "No one has opted into the contributor listing yet."
msgstr "Zatiaľ nikto nepožiadal o zaradenie do zoznamu prispievateľov."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:22
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Choose <strong>List me as a contributor</strong> in <a "
"href=\"%(profile_url)s\">Profile</a> to appear here."
msgstr ""
"Ak sa tu chcete zobraziť, vyberte <strong>Uviesť ma v zozname "
"prispievateľov</strong> v <a href=\"%(profile_url)s\">Profile</a>."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:23
msgid "Questions and suggestions"
msgstr "Otázky a návrhy"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:23
msgid ""
"Tell us what would make the app more useful for your group, or ask about "
"trying it together."
msgstr ""
"Povedzte nám, čo by aplikáciu urobilo užitočnejšou pre vašu skupinu, alebo sa"
" opýtajte na možnosť vyskúšať ju spoločne."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:23
msgid "Contact the project"
msgstr "Kontaktovať projekt"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/about.html:23
msgid ""
"Feedback currently goes to the project contact by email. There is no public "
"forum or automatic AI moderation of these messages."
msgstr ""
"Spätná väzba sa v súčasnosti posiela kontaktnému zástupcovi projektu "
"e-mailom. Neexistuje verejné fórum ani automatické moderovanie týchto správ "
"pomocou AI."

