msgstr "Skontrolovať výsledok"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/audio_study.html:16
msgid ""
"We couldn’t obtain a usable recording. You can try again from the entry or "
"add a human recording. An interrupted provider request may still incur a "
"charge. This attempt will not be sent again automatically."
msgstr ""
"Nepodarilo sa získať použiteľnú nahrávku. Môžete to skúsiť znova z položky "
"alebo pridať ľudskú nahrávku. Prerušená požiadavka poskytovateľovi môže byť "
"aj tak spoplatnená. Tento pokus sa automaticky neodošle znova."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/audio_study.html:17
msgid "This audio preview has been discarded."
msgstr "Táto zvuková ukážka bola zahodená."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/audio_study.html:18
#, python-format
msgid "Estimated API cost: $%(cost)s"
msgstr "Odhadované náklady na API: $%(cost)s"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/audio_study.html:18
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/photo_study.html:21
msgid "(your OpenAI account)"
msgstr "(váš účet OpenAI)"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/audio_study.html:18
msgid ""
". Includes returned pronunciation-guidance usage and estimated speech costs "
"for completed attempts; the provider invoice is authoritative."
