#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:2
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:4
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:42
msgid "Picture-description allowance"
msgstr "Limit opisov obrázkov"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(value1)s of %(value2)s descriptions used in the last 24 hours · %(value3)s "
"remaining."
msgstr ""
"Za posledných 24 hodín bolo použitých %(value1)s z %(value2)s opisov · "
"zostáva %(value3)s."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:7
msgid "Review the daily cost"
msgstr "Skontrolovať denné náklady"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:8
#, python-format
msgid "%(value1)s picture descriptions per 24 hours"
msgstr "%(value1)s opisov obrázkov za 24 hodín"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:9
#, python-format
msgid "Rough daily cost if the full allowance is used: US$%(value1)s"
msgstr "Približné denné náklady pri využití celého limitu: US$%(value1)s"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:10
#, python-format
msgid ""
"About US$%(value1)s per short description, including its sentence and up to "
"six new words with audio."
msgstr ""
"Približne US$%(value1)s za krátky opis, vrátane jeho vety a najviac šiestich "
"nových slov so zvukovou nahrávkou."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:11
msgid ""
"This allowance is shared by all dictionary members. Each request uses the "
"requesting member’s payment settings: their OpenAI key, C-LARA credits, or "
"server funding."
msgstr ""
"Tento limit zdieľajú všetci členovia slovníka. Každá požiadavka používa "
"platobné nastavenia žiadajúceho člena: jeho kľúč OpenAI, kredity C-LARA alebo"
" financovanie serverom."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:12
#, python-format
msgid "Your current C-LARA balance: US$%(value1)s."
msgstr "Váš aktuálny zostatok C-LARA: US$%(value1)s."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:13
msgid ""
"Your balance may not cover the whole estimate if you make all these requests "
"yourself. This does not include other members’ funds."
msgstr ""
"Váš zostatok nemusí pokryť celý odhad, ak všetky tieto požiadavky odošlete "
"sami. Nezahŕňa prostriedky ostatných členov."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:14
msgid ""
"This is an estimate, not a spending cap. Longer descriptions, more "
"vocabulary, pronunciation guidance and retries can cost more. Manual audio "
"retries and other AI tools are additional. Changing the allowance starts no "
"requests and reserves no money."
msgstr ""
"Ide o odhad, nie o strop výdavkov. Dlhšie opisy, viac slovnej zásoby, pokyny "
"k výslovnosti a opakované pokusy môžu stáť viac. Ručné opakovanie zvukových "
"požiadaviek a ďalšie nástroje AI sa účtujú navyše. Zmena limitu nespúšťa "
"žiadne požiadavky a nerezervuje peniaze."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:15
msgid "How the estimate is calculated"
msgstr "Ako sa odhad počíta"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:16
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Model: %(value1)s. Configured rates: US$%(value2)s per million input tokens "
"and US$%(value3)s per million output tokens. Each description is budgeted as "
"12,000 input tokens and 2,600 output tokens, plus US$%(value4)s as an "
"approximate allowance for associated audio, pronunciation guidance and spoken"
" input. These are planning assumptions; actual usage and provider prices may "
"differ. The provider invoice is authoritative."
msgstr ""
"Model: %(value1)s. Nastavené sadzby: US$%(value2)s za milión vstupných "
"tokenov a US$%(value3)s za milión výstupných tokenov. Na každý opis sa v "
"rozpočte počíta s 12 000 vstupnými tokenmi a 2 600 výstupnými tokenmi plus "
"US$%(value4)s ako približná rezerva na súvisiace zvukové nahrávky, pokyny k "
"výslovnosti a hovorený vstup. Ide o predpoklady pre plánovanie; skutočné "
"využitie a ceny poskytovateľa sa môžu líšiť. Rozhodujúca je faktúra "
"poskytovateľa."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:18
msgid ""
"You have already used more than this new allowance. Existing results remain "
"available; new descriptions will wait until enough earlier requests leave the"
" 24-hour window."
msgstr ""
"Už ste využili viac, než povoľuje tento nový limit. Existujúce výsledky "
"zostávajú dostupné; nové opisy počkajú, kým dostatočný počet starších "
"požiadaviek opustí 24-hodinové obdobie."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:20
#, python-format
msgid "Confirm %(value1)s descriptions per 24 hours"
msgstr "Potvrdiť %(value1)s opisov za 24 hodín"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:22
msgid "Change the proposed allowance"
msgstr "Zmeniť navrhovaný limit"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:23
msgid "Choose an allowance"
msgstr "Vybrať limit"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:24
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:46
msgid "Preview daily cost"
msgstr "Zobraziť denné náklady"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:25
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:48
msgid "The server administrator has paused new picture-description requests."
msgstr "Správca servera pozastavil nové požiadavky na opisy obrázkov."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:27
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The window is the preceding 24 hours, not midnight to midnight. Failed and "
"discarded attempts count. Changing the allowance does not reset usage. Your "
"account also has a server ceiling of %(value1)s picture descriptions per 24 "
"hours across all dictionaries."
msgstr ""
"Obdobie zahŕňa predchádzajúcich 24 hodín, nie čas od polnoci do polnoci. "
"Neúspešné a zahodené pokusy sa počítajú. Zmena limitu nevynuluje využitie. "
"Váš účet má tiež serverový strop %(value1)s opisov obrázkov za 24 hodín spolu"
" vo všetkých slovníkoch."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_limit.html:28
msgid "Back to Settings"
msgstr "Späť na Nastavenia"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:1
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:2
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/dictionary.html:6
msgid "Describe a picture"
msgstr "Opísať obrázok"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:2
msgid "Spoken description"
msgstr "Hovorený opis"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:2
msgid ""
"Type, speak or ask AI to suggest a description of your picture. Confirm the "
"meaning, then save a sentence and its words together."
msgstr ""
"Napíšte alebo nahovorte opis obrázka, prípadne požiadajte AI o návrh. "
"Potvrďte význam a potom uložte vetu spolu s jej slovami."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:4
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(value1)s of %(value2)s picture descriptions remaining for this dictionary "
"in the last 24 hours."
msgstr ""
"Za posledných 24 hodín zostáva pre tento slovník %(value1)s z %(value2)s "
"opisov obrázkov."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:5
msgid "Change allowance"
msgstr "Zmeniť limit"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:5
msgid "The owner can change the allowance in Settings."
msgstr "Vlastník môže zmeniť limit v Nastaveniach."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:8
msgid "1. Picture"
msgstr "1. Obrázok"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:9
msgid ""
"This picture is awaiting review. Preparing a suggestion keeps it that way; "
"confirming the description will also accept the picture."
msgstr ""
"Tento obrázok čaká na kontrolu. Príprava návrhu tento stav nemení; potvrdením"
" opisu sa schváli aj obrázok."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:10
msgid "Picture to describe"
msgstr "Obrázok na opísanie"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:12
msgid "Picture source"
msgstr "Zdroj obrázka"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:12
msgid "Camera"
msgstr "Fotoaparát"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:12
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:14
msgid "Choose a picture"
msgstr "Vybrať obrázok"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:16
msgid "2. Describe this picture"
msgstr "2. Opíšte tento obrázok"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:21
msgid ""
"AI will suggest a short description of what it can see. You can change the "
"description and its words before saving."
msgstr ""
"AI navrhne krátky opis toho, čo vidí. Pred uložením môžete opis a jeho slová "
"zmeniť."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:22
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Rough estimate: US$%(value1)s for a short description and up to six words "
"with audio. Actual usage varies."
msgstr ""
"Približný odhad: US$%(value1)s za krátky opis a najviac šesť slov so "
"zvukovými nahrávkami. Skutočné využitie sa líši."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:22
msgid "Your own OpenAI key is used."
msgstr "Používa sa váš vlastný kľúč OpenAI."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:22
msgid "Costs are charged to your C-LARA account when credits are enabled."
msgstr "Ak sú kredity zapnuté, náklady sa účtujú na váš účet C-LARA."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:22
msgid "A failed or interrupted call may still incur a provider charge."
msgstr ""
"Aj neúspešná alebo prerušená požiadavka môže byť poskytovateľom spoplatnená."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:23
msgid ""
"OpenAI receives this picture, your description when supplied, and up to 200 "
"existing words and meanings to help reuse vocabulary. Spoken input is "
"transcribed. Confirmation speech and dictionary audio are synthetic."
msgstr ""
"OpenAI dostane tento obrázok, váš opis, ak ho zadáte, a najviac 200 "
"existujúcich slov a významov na podporu opätovného použitia slovnej zásoby. "
"Hovorený vstup sa prepíše na text. Hlasové potvrdenie a zvukové nahrávky "
"slovníka sú syntetické."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:25
msgid "Prepare suggestion"
msgstr "Pripraviť návrh"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_start.html:27
msgid "Recent descriptions — continue or discard"
msgstr "Nedávne opisy — pokračovať alebo zahodiť"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_vocabulary.html:3
msgid "Words and expressions — edit, add or remove"
msgstr "Slová a výrazy — upraviť, pridať alebo odstrániť"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/capture_vocabulary.html:4
msgid ""
"Keep useful expressions together, for example “sträcka ut sig”. Leave the "
"sentence-form field blank if you are adding a related word. Up to 12 words or"
" expressions; audio will be created for those you keep."
msgstr ""
