msgstr "● Nahrávať"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/recording.html:9
msgid "Check microphone"
msgstr "Skontrolovať mikrofón"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/recording.html:12
msgid "Microphone input level"
msgstr "Úroveň vstupu mikrofónu"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/recording.html:13
msgid "The level will move when sound reaches the microphone."
msgstr "Ukazovateľ sa bude pohybovať, keď mikrofón zachytí zvuk."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/recording.html:15
msgid "Ready when you are"
msgstr "Pripravené, keď budete pripravení vy"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/recording.html:18
msgid "Remove this recording"
msgstr "Odstrániť túto nahrávku"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/recording.html:19
msgid "Or choose an audio file"
msgstr "Alebo vybrať zvukový súbor"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/recording.html:20
msgid ""
"Listen before sharing. You can record again. Up to 90 seconds or a 15 MB "
"file."
msgstr ""
"Pred zdieľaním si nahrávku vypočujte. Môžete ju nahrať znova. Najviac 90 "
"sekúnd alebo súbor s veľkosťou 15 MB."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/save_controls.html:1
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Uložiť"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/save_controls.html:5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"By choosing %(value1)s, I confirm I have permission to share what I add with "
"this dictionary."
msgstr ""
"Výberom možnosti %(value1)s potvrdzujem, že mám povolenie zdieľať svoj "
"príspevok v tomto slovníku."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/sentence_links.html:2
msgid "Vocabulary needs updating to match the current sentence and meanings."
msgstr ""
"Slovnú zásobu treba aktualizovať, aby zodpovedala aktuálnej vete a významom."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/sentence_links.html:2
msgid "Review vocabulary from accepted sentences"
msgstr "Skontrolovať slovnú zásobu zo schválených viet"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/sentence_links.html:4
msgid "Sentences about this picture"
msgstr "Vety o tomto obrázku"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/sentence_links.html:5
msgid "Original picture and discussion →"
msgstr "Pôvodný obrázok a diskusia →"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:6
msgid "Workflow suggestions"
msgstr "Návrhy ďalších krokov"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:6
msgid ""
"Show a useful next step while browsing and on your dictionary card. "
"Suggestions are for the owner only. Nothing is sent to AI until you approve "
"the displayed scope and cost."
msgstr ""
"Pri prehliadaní a na karte slovníka zobrazovať užitočný ďalší krok. Návrhy sa"
" zobrazujú iba vlastníkovi. AI sa nič neposiela, kým neschválite zobrazený "
"rozsah a cenu."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:6
msgid "On"
msgstr "Zapnuté"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:6
msgid "Turn off workflow suggestions"
msgstr "Vypnúť návrhy ďalších krokov"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:6
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Vypnuté"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:6
msgid "Show workflow suggestions"
msgstr "Zobraziť návrhy ďalších krokov"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:6
msgid "The other Settings controls remain available either way."
msgstr ""
"Ostatné ovládacie prvky v Nastaveniach zostávajú dostupné v oboch prípadoch."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:7
msgid "Discoverability"
msgstr "Vyhľadateľnosť"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:7
msgid "On — listed in Find dictionaries"
msgstr "Zapnutá — uvedený v časti Nájsť slovníky"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:7
msgid "Off — not listed"
msgstr "Vypnutá — neuvedený v zozname"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:8
msgid ""
"List this dictionary's name, languages and accepted entry counts so anyone "
"can find it and ask to join. Your chosen public name is shown only if you opt"
" into the contributor listing in Profile. Contents remain private unless you "
"separately enable public browsing below."
msgstr ""
"Zverejniť názov tohto slovníka, jeho jazyky a počty schválených položiek, aby"
" ho mohol ktokoľvek nájsť a požiadať o členstvo. Vami zvolené verejné meno sa"
" zobrazí iba vtedy, ak sa prihlásite do zoznamu prispievateľov v Profile. "
"Obsah zostáva súkromný, pokiaľ nižšie osobitne nepovolíte verejné "
"prehliadanie."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:9
msgid "Turn off discoverability"
msgstr "Vypnúť vyhľadateľnosť"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:9
msgid "Make this dictionary visible before listing it."
msgstr "Pred zaradením do zoznamu nastavte tento slovník ako viditeľný."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:9
msgid "Make dictionary discoverable"
msgstr "Umožniť vyhľadanie slovníka"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:10
msgid "View discovery listing"
msgstr "Zobraziť záznam vo vyhľadávaní"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:13
msgid "On — anyone can browse"
msgstr "Zapnuté — prehliadať môže ktokoľvek"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:13
msgid "Off — members only"
msgstr "Vypnuté — iba členovia"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:16
msgid "Link to share"
msgstr "Odkaz na zdieľanie"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:17
msgid "Turn off public browsing"
msgstr "Vypnúť verejné prehliadanie"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:19
msgid ""
"Let anyone browse accepted pictures, sentences, words, translations and "
"recordings, without an account. Its link works directly; turn on "
"Discoverability above to include it in the dictionary list."
msgstr ""
"Umožniť komukoľvek bez účtu prehliadať schválené obrázky, vety, slová, "
"preklady a nahrávky. Priamy odkaz funguje; ak chcete slovník zaradiť do "
"zoznamu, zapnite vyššie Vyhľadateľnosť."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:20
msgid ""
"Only enable this with your contributors’ permission. Future accepted content "
"will also be public. Drafts, discussions and member details remain private."
msgstr ""
"Povoľte to iba so súhlasom prispievateľov. Verejný bude aj budúci schválený "
"obsah. Koncepty, diskusie a údaje o členoch zostávajú súkromné."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:21
msgid "Make this dictionary visible below before enabling public browsing."
msgstr ""
"Pred povolením verejného prehliadania nastavte slovník nižšie ako viditeľný."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:24
msgid "Enable public browsing"
msgstr "Povoliť verejné prehliadanie"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:26
msgid ""
"Turning this off, hiding the dictionary or withdrawing content blocks future "
"visitor access to that material. It cannot recall copies that visitors have "
"already saved. Public browsing does not give visitors editing, AI-generation "
"or export permissions."
msgstr ""
"Vypnutie tejto možnosti, skrytie slovníka alebo stiahnutie obsahu zo "
"zdieľania zablokuje budúci prístup návštevníkov k danému obsahu. Nedokáže "
"však odvolať kópie, ktoré si návštevníci už uložili. Verejné prehliadanie "
"nedáva návštevníkom právo upravovať, generovať pomocou AI ani exportovať."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:28
msgid "Rename dictionary"
msgstr "Premenovať slovník"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:29
msgid "Save name"
msgstr "Uložiť názov"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:30
msgid ""
"Try carrier-based AI audio for English, French, Swedish, German, Italian and "
"Icelandic multi-word entries, or explicitly selected Japanese entries. "
"Earlier audio is retained; human recordings are protected."
msgstr ""
"Vyskúšajte audio generované AI pomocou nosných fráz pre viacslovné výrazy v "
"angličtine, francúzštine, švédčine, nemčine, taliančine a islandčine alebo "
"pre výslovne vybrané japonské položky. Predchádzajúce audio sa uchováva; "
"ľudské nahrávky sú chránené."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:31
#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:33
msgid "Add missing sentences"
msgstr "Pridať chýbajúce vety"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:32
msgid ""
"Suggest sentences for pictures that do not yet have them, then build their "
"vocabulary. Review each stage or accept all ready suggestions."
msgstr ""
"Navrhnite vety k obrázkom, ktoré ich ešte nemajú, a potom vytvorte ich slovnú"
" zásobu. Skontrolujte každú fázu alebo schváľte všetky pripravené návrhy."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:36
msgid "Visible"
msgstr "Viditeľný"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:36
msgid "in the dictionary list."
msgstr "v zozname slovníkov."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:37
msgid ""
"Hide an older or unused dictionary to keep the main list clear for everyone. "
"Members can still find it under Hidden dictionaries or open a saved link. "
"Hiding also turns off discoverability and public browsing; making it visible "
"again does not turn either back on. Content and contribution rights are "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Skryte starší alebo nepoužívaný slovník, aby hlavný zoznam zostal prehľadný "
"pre všetkých. Členovia ho stále nájdu v časti Skryté slovníky alebo otvoria "
"uložený odkaz. Skrytie zároveň vypne vyhľadateľnosť a verejné prehliadanie; "
"opätovné zviditeľnenie ich znova nezapne. Obsah a práva prispievateľov "
"zostávajú nezmenené."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:39
msgid "Make dictionary visible"
msgstr "Zviditeľniť slovník"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:40
msgid "Hide dictionary"
msgstr "Skryť slovník"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:43
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(used)s of %(limit)s descriptions used in the last 24 hours · %(remaining)s "
"remaining."
msgstr ""
"Za posledných 24 hodín bolo použitých %(used)s z %(limit)s opisov · zostáva "
"%(remaining)s."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:47
msgid ""
"Review the estimate, then confirm. The new allowance applies to Picture "
"descriptions; other AI tools have their own limits."
msgstr ""
"Skontrolujte odhad a potom ho potvrďte. Nový limit platí pre Opisy obrázkov; "
"ostatné nástroje AI majú vlastné limity."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:50
msgid "Language versions"
msgstr "Jazykové verzie"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:51
msgid "Create a version in another language"
msgstr "Vytvoriť verziu v inom jazyku"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:52
msgid "Build or update vocabulary from accepted sentences"
msgstr "Vytvoriť alebo aktualizovať slovnú zásobu zo schválených viet"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:52
msgid "Update this version from its source dictionary"
msgstr "Aktualizovať túto verziu zo zdrojového slovníka"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:53
msgid ""
"Preview the cost, approve processing, then review the translated entries."
msgstr ""
"Zobraziť odhad ceny, schváliť spracovanie a potom skontrolovať preložené "
"položky."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:54
msgid "Testing picture descriptions"
msgstr "Testovanie opisov obrázkov"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:55
msgid ""
"Create a fresh dictionary from accepted images, pictures awaiting review, or "
"both. Copied pictures start awaiting review."
msgstr ""
"Vytvorte nový slovník zo schválených obrázkov, z obrázkov čakajúcich na "
"kontrolu alebo z oboch skupín. Skopírované obrázky najprv čakajú na kontrolu."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:56
msgid "Create an image-only copy"
msgstr "Vytvoriť kópiu obsahujúcu iba obrázky"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:58
msgid "Dictionary settings"
msgstr "Nastavenia slovníka"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:59
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "Uložiť nastavenia"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:61
msgid "The dictionary owner manages its name, languages and AI options."
msgstr "Názov slovníka, jeho jazyky a možnosti AI spravuje vlastník slovníka."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:64
msgid "Choose the shared style for AI-generated pictures."
msgstr "Vyberte spoločný štýl pre obrázky generované AI."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:65
msgid "Set up or view image style"
msgstr "Nastaviť alebo zobraziť štýl obrázkov"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:66
msgid "Enable AI picture generation above and save to set up an image style."
msgstr ""
"Ak chcete nastaviť štýl obrázkov, zapnite vyššie generovanie obrázkov pomocou"
" AI a uložte nastavenia."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:66
msgid ""
"The owner can enable AI picture generation here before you set up a style."
msgstr ""
"Vlastník tu môže zapnúť generovanie obrázkov pomocou AI, až potom môžete "
"nastaviť štýl."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:67
msgid ""
"You can always take or upload your own pictures, whether AI generation is "
"enabled or not."
msgstr ""
"Vlastné obrázky môžete vždy fotografovať alebo nahrávať bez ohľadu na to, či "
"je generovanie pomocou AI zapnuté."

